      "title": "Demonstratives: dieser, diese, dieses",
      "explanation": "Use dieser, diese and dieses to point to something specific (this, these). The endings follow the gender of the noun: dieser Tisch (masculine), diese Lampe (feminine), dieses Buch (neuter), diese Kinder (plural). They work like the definite article: the ending carries the gender signal. The same words cover 'these' in the plural.",
      "examples": [
        {
          "de": "Dieser Tisch ist neu.",
          "en": "This table is new."
        },
        {
          "de": "Diese Lampe ist alt.",
          "en": "This lamp is old."
        },
        {
          "de": "Dieses Buch ist gut.",
          "en": "This book is good."
        }
