      "skill_id": "de-a1-015",
      "title": "Dative pronouns in frequent expressions",
      "explanation": "Learn the dative pronouns inside frequent chunks: mir (me), dir (you, one friend), ihm (him), ihr (her), uns (us), euch (you, several friends), ihnen (them). Typical frames are Wie geht es dir? (How are you?), Mir geht es gut, Das gefällt mir (I like it), Ich helfe ihm (I help him) and Anna hilft mir. Do not use the accusative here: mir, not mich, after helfen and gefallen.",
      "examples": [
        {
          "de": "Wie geht es dir?",
          "en": "How are you?"
        },
        {
          "de": "Das gefällt mir.",
          "en": "I like that."
        },
        {
          "de": "Ich helfe ihm.",
          "en": "I help him."
        }
      ],
